  "description": "The All New ZX-1 EVO\n\nAn evolution. For it's 20th birthday the ZX-1 has been given the 'EVO' treatment. A fresh aero design, optimised by aerodynamic specialists based at the famoust Silverstone race track has resulted in a frameset offering 18% less drag than the previous ZX-1. All new and much refined Race-Fit geometry including a longer top tube, lower front end and shorter chain stays gives the perfect balance of fit and control.\n\nThe ZX-1 EVO CRS come fitted with Shimano's class leading Ultegra R8000 hydraulic disc brake groupset. From the superb stiffness to weight of the chainset, to the ultra reliable hydraulic disc brakes, and the slick shifting, this groupset really ticks all the boxes.\n\nThe CRS Di2 is paired with Reynolds AR58/62 DB carbon wheels, featuring wide carbon rims, Sapim spokes and a lifetime Reynolds warranty. The wheels come tubeless ready, and fitted with Schwalbe's Pro ONE Preformance TLE tyres.\n\nRace-Fit geometry\n\nSL UD Carbon aero frame and fork with integrated seat clamp\n\nFull internal cable routing\n\nShimano Ultegra R8000 groupset\n\nReynolds AR58/62 DB Carbon wheelset\n\nPrime Primavera Carbon aero handlebar",
